---
// SiteFloor — the floor of every page (Jon, 2026-09-21, from his reference
// shot): the email and the LinkedIn mark, centred, nothing else. The city
// and the résumé link left every floor; the rail, the bottom bar and the
// homepage corner carry résumé. ONE object sitewide so it cannot drift the
// way the night switch did. Pages own placement only (margins, rules,
// order) through `:global(.floor)`, and hand in their inks through
// --floor-ink (the email) / --floor-dim (the mark) / --floor-hot (hover);
// the fallbacks are the sitewide tokens, which flip at night.
---

<footer class="floor">
  <a class="floor-mail" href="mailto:jtollefson123@gmail.com">jtollefson123@gmail.com</a>
  <a class="floor-li" href="https://linkedin.com/in/jtollefson123" aria-label="LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3" />
      <path d="M8 11v5" /><path d="M8 8v.01" />
      <path d="M12 16v-5" /><path d="M16 16v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0" />
    </svg>
  </a>
</footer>

<style>
  .floor {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 22px;
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--floor-dim, var(--muted, #6a6660));
  }
  .floor-mail {
    color: var(--floor-ink, var(--text, #141210));
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }
  .floor-mail:hover,
  .floor-mail:focus-visible {
    color: var(--floor-hot, var(--accent, #b33a2a));
  }
  .floor-li {
    display: inline-flex;
    padding: 8px;
    margin: -8px;
    color: var(--floor-dim, var(--muted, #6a6660));
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }
  .floor-li svg {
    width: 21px;
    height: 21px;
  }
  .floor-li:hover,
  .floor-li:focus-visible {
    color: var(--floor-hot, var(--accent, #b33a2a));
  }
</style>
